  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for the Coordination and Monitoring of EU Funded Education and Youth Empowerment in North-Western Nigeria &#xbf; EYEPINN and ``Education and Youth Empowerment in Nigeria (2nd phase): Expand, Integrate and Strengthen Systems (EISS) to build teachers&#xbf; capacity and resilience&#xbf;&#xbf;.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Service Contract will be procured through 2023 SEA FWC. The Consultant will be responsible for the general coordination and monitoring of the objectives of the Education and Youth Empowerment Programmes (1st and 2nd phases) at the National and in the 9 participating States: of Jigawa, Kano and Sokoto in North western Nigeria and in geographical zones of Adamawa, Beyelsa, Enugu, Katsina, Plateau and Oyo.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
